{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentinginperson"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In person, the holder shows a QR code and the reader scans it: the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code carries the holder’s ephemeral key and how to reach it over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Bluetooth LE. The two devices then exchange encrypted messages over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GATT. The package carries the Bluetooth side itself: your app shows or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scans the QR code, follows the session’s states, and asks the holder."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Engagement is by QR code only. NFC engagement (a tap instead of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code) is in OID4VCgo’s Kotlin library, not this package: an iOS holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t answer a reader’s tap, and an iOS reader can’t tap a holder. An"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Android reader or holder that offers both still works with this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"package over the QR code."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both sides need "},{"code":"NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the app’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Info.plist. Keep the app in the foreground during a session: neither"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"side keeps one going while the app is suspended. A session answers one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request. Bluetooth failures are "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"s; protocol failures","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Share-as-the-holder","text":"Share as the holder","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startProximityPresentation(timeouts:modes:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/qrCode","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"show. It offers both "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityBLEMode","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"s by default: it advertises","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"for the reader and scans for it at once, until a reader connects","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either way (a reader offered both should connect in central client"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode). Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"modes"},{"type":"text","text":" to offer one. It then reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/State-swift.enum\/requestReceived(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with who is asking"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and what: ask the holder, then respond or decline."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ What the holder agreed to share: a requested document, the held","\/\/\/ mdoc to answer it with, and the elements to disclose.","struct InPersonAnswer {","    let document: Int","    let credentialID: String","    let elements: [MdocPresentation.Element]","}","","\/\/\/ Shares an mdoc in person. `showQRCode` displays the code; `consent`","\/\/\/ shows the reader's request and returns the holder's answer, or nil","\/\/\/ to decline. Returns whether the copy shared had been seen by another","\/\/\/ Verifier, or nil when nothing was shared.","func shareInPerson(wallet: Wallet, showQRCode: (String) -> Void,","                   consent: (ProximityPresentation.Request) async -> InPersonAnswer?) async throws -> Bool? {","    let session = try wallet.startProximityPresentation()","    showQRCode(session.qrCode)","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .requestReceived(let request):","            guard let answer = await consent(request) else {","                await session.decline()","                return nil","            }","            \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks.","            return try await session.respond(document: answer.document, credentialID: answer.credentialID,","                                             elements: answer.elements)","        case .failed(let error):","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","            continue","        }","    }","    return nil","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Show "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/Request\/reader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on the consent screen. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader that signs its request (reader authentication) is named, and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity\/Status-swift.enum\/trusted","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" when its certificate chains","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". An unsigned request could"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"come from anyone who scanned the code. As over the Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ends a session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from any other reader before the holder sees it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/cancel()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ends a session at any point, as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder leaves the screen, say. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" sets how long it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"waits: by default 60 seconds for a reader to connect, 30 for its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request, and 300 for the holder to decide."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Read as the verifier","anchor":"Read-as-the-verifier"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" needs no "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": give it the IACAs whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mdocs it accepts, and, to sign its requests so holders see who is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asking, a key in a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and its certificate chain, with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader authentication extended key usage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderConfiguration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). The reader is a production one: it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses ("},{"code":"invalidInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") a configuration that leaves a decision open:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which IACAs issue which document types ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"anyIssuerForAnyType"},{"type":"text","text":", or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issuerRootsByDocType"},{"type":"text","text":"), and each role’s revocation ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revocation"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"crls"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"noRevocationCheck"},{"type":"text","text":" to decline). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"development"},{"type":"text","text":" relaxes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this, for trying out a development issuer’s documents; never ship an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app with it set. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader\/start(qrCode:docType:elements:timeouts:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes the holder’s QR code and what to ask for."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Reads an mDL's name and portrait from the holder whose QR code was","\/\/\/ scanned. Returns the verified mdoc, or nil if the holder declined or","\/\/\/ the mdoc isn't known to be unrevoked.","func readInPerson(qrCode: String, issuerRoots: String, crls: String) async throws -> VerifiedMdoc? {","    let reader = try ProximityReader(configuration: ProximityReaderConfiguration(","        issuerRoots: issuerRoots, crls: crls, revocation: [.issuer, .status],","        anyIssuerForAnyType: true))","    let session = try reader.start(qrCode: qrCode, docType: \"org.iso.18013.5.1.mDL\",","                                   elements: [\"org.iso.18013.5.1\": [\"given_name\", \"family_name\", \"portrait\"]])","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .verified(let mdoc):","            let status = try await session.checkStatus()","            return status == .valid || status == .noStatus ? mdoc : nil","        case .failed(let error):","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","            continue","        }","    }","    return nil","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" carries the disclosed elements, the document signer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the IACA it chains to, and its validity. Decide which issuers to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accept on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/issuerChain","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the verified certificate path:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/issuer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/trustAnchor","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are names any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document signer under a trusted IACA can choose, for display."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The session doesn’t check revocation itself:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderSession\/checkStatus()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" does, once the session is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".verified"},{"type":"text","text":". It fetches the issuer’s status list over the network, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the reader needs a connection then, and verifies the list is signed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"under the certificate the document names or the CA that signed the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document signer (ISO\/IEC 18013-5 §12.3.6). Rely on the document only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when it’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/valid","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/noStatus","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Share an mdoc with a reader nearby over Bluetooth, or be the reader,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with ISO\/IEC 18013-5 device retrieval."}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Presenting in person","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Presenting in person","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError"],"anchor":"Presenting-in-person"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityReader":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"ProximityReader","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ProximityReader","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An ISO\/IEC 18013-5 mdoc reader: a verifier asking for an mdoc in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"person over BLE. It needs no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":". The key store holds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader’s key, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProximityReaderConfiguration.readerKeyID"},{"type":"text","text":"; none for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader that doesn’t sign."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader","title":"ProximityReader","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximityreader"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityReaderIdentity/Status-swift.enum/trusted":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity\/Status-swift.enum\/trusted","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximityreaderidentity\/status-swift.enum\/trusted","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Signed by a certificate that chains to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WalletConfiguration.mdocReaderRoots"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"ProximityReaderIdentity.Status.trusted","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"trusted","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/VerifiedMdoc/trustAnchor":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/trustAnchor","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/verifiedmdoc\/trustanchor","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The common name of the IACA it chains to, for display."}],"title":"trustAnchor","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"trustAnchor","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocStatus/valid":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Neither revoked nor suspended."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/valid","title":"MdocStatus.valid","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocstatus\/valid","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"valid","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth."}],"title":"OID4VCWallet","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityPresentation/Request/reader":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reader","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ProximityReaderIdentity","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet23ProximityReaderIdentityV"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Who sent the request."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/Request\/reader","title":"reader","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximitypresentation\/request\/reader"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityReaderSession/checkStatus()":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkStatus","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MdocStatus","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet10MdocStatusO","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Checks the revocation status of the mdoc the session verified:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fetches the Token Status List its MSO names, over https from a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"public address, and verifies it’s signed under the certificate the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"MSO names or else under the CA that signed the document signer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(ISO\/IEC 18013-5 §12.3.6). Rely on the document only when this is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".valid"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".noStatus"},{"type":"text","text":". Call it once the session is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".verified"},{"type":"text","text":", after"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Bluetooth connection has closed; before, it throws "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WalletError"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".wrongStep"},{"type":"text","text":". A failed fetch is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".network"},{"type":"text","text":", a list that doesn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verify "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".protocol"},{"type":"text","text":"; cancelling the calling Task cancels it. The list"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers many documents, so fetching it doesn’t tell its publisher"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"which one was presented.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderSession\/checkStatus()","title":"checkStatus()","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximityreadersession\/checkstatus()"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential store and Wallet Provider."}],"title":"Wallet","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Wallet"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Wallet"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocStatus/noStatus":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The MSO names no revocation list."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/noStatus","title":"MdocStatus.noStatus","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"noStatus"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocstatus\/nostatus","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An error from OID4VCgo: a stable "},{"code":"code","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the issuer’s, Authorization","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Server’s or Verifier’s own error code when it gave one","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"protocolError"},{"type":"text","text":"), and a message for logs: it never carries personal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"data, a remote party’s own description, a URL’s path or query, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"control characters. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"localizedDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a sentence fit to show the holder; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isRetryable"},{"type":"text","text":" says whether trying"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same step again may succeed."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError","title":"WalletError","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletError","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.O